  "reviewFindings": [
    "No production attention defect found: selected-key membership and carry bounds are preserved; only FP32 grouping changes beyond one selection window.",
    "Fixed gpu_probe missing-input/output failures and silent context truncation; documented next-token logit alignment.",
    "Deep HTTP AR/MTP completion hashes cannot establish verification parity when cache frontiers differ. This occurs in the base too. Separate matched-prefill 32K/128K session checks pass.",
    "Depth-grid calibration changes the generated benchmark prompt; performance controls use an identical grid.",
    "Later main changes affect cache identity, tokenizer/server features and constraints rather than this attention kernel. Qualification is for the exact PR head identified above."
